    "detailed_description": "Prove you are human to the anoying CAPTCHA so it lets you through.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159060/extras/a6e6ad36ae1c286e93c449b7a50bf92b.poster.avif?t=1737398012\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159060/extras/a6e6ad36ae1c286e93c449b7a50bf92b.webm?t=1737398012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159060/extras/a6e6ad36ae1c286e93c449b7a50bf92b.mp4?t=1737398012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Solve puzzles and minigames. Your identity result will change according to your actions as you solve new challenges, be nice (or be as annoying as you wish). Discover different identities to unveil secrets and reach the ending of the story!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159060/extras/9784aaa95c4c8e3fd8da4c83a761e121.poster.avif?t=1737398012\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159060/extras/9784aaa95c4c8e3fd8da4c83a761e121.webm?t=1737398012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159060/extras/9784aaa95c4c8e3fd8da4c83a761e121.mp4?t=1737398012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fully narrated (by an annoying little guy).<br></li><li>More than 30 unique puzzles and minigames to enjoy.<br></li><li>Multiple sub-endings to discover.<br></li><li>Different action paths to take in most puzzles!<br></li><li>Inspired in &quot;There Is No Game&quot;. This is a game though.<br></li><li>Make the little guy mad, or happy, you do you. I don't like him that much to be honest.<br></li><li>A comedic themed story that hides grim secrets.<br></li><li>Has an ending!</li></ul>",
